<translate>
==== EnduranceChange ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Used for food. Indicates how much endurance the food will remove. If the number is negative, endurance will decrease, if positive, it will increase.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
EnduranceChange = 2,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

